    "body": "> **1B** Allow DOMString? reflection for attributes starting with aria-* only, as a legacy exception.\r\n\r\nShould this include `role` as well? [`role` is the only prop in `ARIAMixin`](https://w3c.github.io/aria/#ARIAMixin) which does not start with `aria`, but it does behave like the others in browsers.",
