    "updated_at": "2025-02-26T22:18:52Z",
    "body": "This issue can be closed as completed; see merged PR: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10974.\n\nARIA's needs are met with the `DOMString?` getter update however, I've opened a new issue to address adding HTML guidance on attribute design and IDL attribute usage (e.g., discouraging `DOMString?` for non-enumerated attributes) per @annevk @domenic's comments: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10974#issuecomment-2683729885:\n\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11078\n\nCC @cookiecrook @jnurthen @spectranaut",
